  <div class="markdown summary"><p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Tests.EventSystemTests.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="2" sourceendlinenumber="3">Comprehensive test suite for EventSystem class.
Tests event subscription, publishing, error handling, and lifecycle management.</p>
<p sourcefile="api/GameFramework.Tests.EventSystemTests.yml" sourcestartlinenumber="5" sourceendlinenumber="7">Design: Isolated tests with event handler validation
Pros: Covers all event system functionality, tests error scenarios
Cons: Async testing complexity, event handler timing considerations</p>
</div>
